<p>Hits the target twice, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">91%, 104%, 114%, 122%, 130%</acronym> weapon damage each hit. You gain life equal to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 15%, 17%, 20%, 21%</acronym> of the damage dealt, and you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7, 11, 15, 18, 21</acronym> vim for each attack that hits.</p>